**dualsense-edge.hpp does DualSense Edge input decoding and driver declaration.**

## Interface

`decode_dualsense_edge(span<const byte> report, connection link, raw_sample& raw, canonical_sample& canonical) noexcept` delegates shared decoding while retaining Edge rear-button and back-button capability data.

`dualsense_edge_driver : dualsense_driver` inherits `dualsense_driver::dualsense_driver`, overrides `family() const noexcept` to return `controller::family::dualsense_edge`, and declares `poll(raw_sample&, canonical_sample&) noexcept`.

## Integration

`dualsense_edge_driver` reuses `dualsense_driver` HID reads and `dualsense_input_report`; product-ID identification occurs before `decode_dualsense_edge`.

`types.hpp` supplies `span`, `byte`, `connection`, `raw_sample`, and `canonical_sample`; `utility.hpp` supplies support utilities; `dualsense.hpp` supplies the base driver and shared decoder.